                                "tr": "Genç <w>küstahlar</w> gülüştüler ve yaşlı adamla alay etmeye devam ettiler.",
                                "nl": "De jonge <w>brutale jongeren</w> lachten en bleven de oude man bespotten."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "He was known as a rebel and an <w>insolent</w> who refused to follow any rules.",
